abstract: >-
  An evidence-driven Quality Engineering framework for using AI agents to assist
  API test analysis, generation, workflow composition, execution planning,
  regression selection and failure triage while keeping API contracts,
  authorization policy, business rules and real execution evidence
  authoritative. The work covers REST, GraphQL, authentication, RBAC,
  ownership, contract testing, persistence, asynchronous events, dependency
  failures, retries, idempotency, structured agent outputs, test traceability,
  coverage, CI/CD quality gates and production-to-regression learning.
